Z||000006||MinnGreenGT||11-14-2001||10:04 AM||||<B>Gary!</B> Nice to see you online-  Actually there are already a couple of pics of your car here... from the 1st night at MOA.  Check 'em out here: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010656.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010656.html</A> <P>Here's your car again!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MNO_03.jpg"> <P>Oh yeah... Gary is using colored glass bulbs (never use "coated" bulbs- they don't last) in his clear taillights. They look pretty good.  (BTW Gary- I finished mine here: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/011212.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/011212.html</A>  )<P>Too bad you missed us last weekend at the MOA again... we had 10 cars show up- and most of us stuck together until the Cops effective kicked us out of St.Paul.  Next time!<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||California Kid||11-14-2001||10:36 AM||||Welcome to the Forum Slammed, Nice car! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>19 Shows in one year!!! You're really dedicated!  Glad to see I'm not the only one going up against the Vette's, GTO's, and everything else.  I generally get "classed" 1971 to 1994 Modified here in Michigan. I don't think the class is fair, but generally walk away with a trophy.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature_7.jpg"> ||||reg||1
